open Matrix
open NumberField Formalism.BasicNotions Formalism.MainNotions.S Formalism.MainNotions.S.Lat Formalism.MainNotions.S.LocalSplitGroups Formalism.L2.SG.CntLocal Formalism.L2.SG.Pf.PCount

